<title>USA: Euphonix names Margerum CEO.</title>
<headline>Euphonix names Margerum CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Euphonix Inc said Barry Margerum was named chief executive, succeeding James Dobbie, who will keep the title of chairman and work for the company on a part-time basis.</p>
<p>Margerum most recently was president and general manager of the Computer and Mobile Systems Division of Plantronics Inc.</p>
